Question: 30. What is ConcurrentHashMap?

Input:
Multiple threads update account status values.

Code:
ConcurrentHashMap<String, String> accounts = new ConcurrentHashMap<>();
accounts.put("A101", "ACTIVE");
accounts.compute("A101", (id, old) -> "BLOCKED");
